  <title>W01 Quiz: WhatsApp </title>
  <description>&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;: Get set up with the group you will be working with throughout the course.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Task&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Set up WhatsApp, join your WhatsApp group, and introduce yourself to your group in WhatsApp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Background&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You will be put into two WhatsApp groups. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;One group is for the instructor to communicate with the class through announcements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;The other group is for you to work with your classmates on assignments. Remember these groups, and the information in these groups (including WhatsApp contact information) is only to be used for class purposes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Instructions - do NOT start this quiz until you have posted in WhatsApp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style="list-style-type: none;"&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Download&lt;/strong&gt; WhatsApp (if you do not already have it downloaded) from &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/whatsapp-messenger/id310633997" target="_blank"&gt;Apple App Store&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://www.whatsapp.com/android/" target="_blank"&gt;Android Download&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://www.whatsapp.com/download/" target="_blank"&gt;PC/MAC Desktop Download&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Your WhatsApp link is in an email sent on Monday, the&lt;strong&gt; first day of class,&lt;/strong&gt; from your instructor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;In&lt;strong&gt; WhatsApp: P&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ost&lt;/strong&gt; 'hi' to your group after joining your group&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(You will only see comments after you post. You will see nothing before your post.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;You can not post in WhatsApp until you get the link from your instructor.&lt;strong&gt; Do NOT submit a Help ticket asking for the link. &lt;/strong&gt;Only your instructor has your link.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Do &lt;strong&gt;NOT&lt;/strong&gt; start this quiz until you have posted in your WhatsApp group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</description>
